{"study_accession":"PRJNA1241147","secondary_study_accession":"SRP572813","title":"Super-enhancers-driven SOX4/SMAD3 enhances AXL signaling via membrane phospholipid remodeling to accelerate leukemia progression [RNA-Seq]","description":"Cancer often involves aberrant epigenetic activation. In CML-BP, super - enhancer - driven SOX4 and SMAD3 form an auto - regulatory axis. They co - regulate epigenome, activate AXL - related pathways, and mediate membrane phospholipid remodeling. Bemcentinib, an AXL inhibitor, can inhibit CML - BP progression. SOX4/SMAD3 are key factors and Bemcentinib a potential therapy. Overall design: RNA-seq profiling of indicated patient's samples and LAMA-84 cells RNA-seq profiling of KBM5 cells","pubmed":"41721601","geo_series":"","n_samples":30,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN47556165","study_accession":"PRJNA1241147","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"Patient tissue, CP-15_FRAS210213058-1r","description":"Patient tissue, CP-15_FRAS210213058-1r","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-05-16","attributes":[["collection_date","missing"],["INSDC secondary accession","SRS24480314"],["NCBI submission package","Generic.1.0"],["organism","Homo sapiens"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["tissue","Bone marrow"],["cell type","Chronic myeloid leukemia chronic phase cells"],["source_name","Bone marrow"],["BioSampleModel","Generic"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2026-05-15"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2026-05-15"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR32842110","experiment_accession":"SRX28124697","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"DNBSEQ-T7","read_count":27802714,"base_count":8340814200,"first_public":"2026-05-16","experiment_title":"DNBSEQ-T7 sequencing: GSM8864140: Patient tissue, CP-15_FRAS210213058-1r Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN47556166","study_accession":"PRJNA1241147","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"Patien